    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (Enterprise Tax Plan Base Rate Entities) Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 94, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	3</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Main amendments	4</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Amendments applying from the 2017-18 year of income	4</p>
